    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p>Proton Grenades throw out a high-energy burst of accelerated particles capable of disassembling matter at a molecular level. A Proton Grenade detonates on impact.</p><p>When you make an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a> with a Proton Grenade, make a single attack roll and compare the result to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> of every target in the Grenade's 3-Square <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a> radius. Targets you hit take full damage, and targets you miss take half damage.</p><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Proton_Grenades\"><b>Proton Grenades</b></span></h4>",
